  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Primary pill with shared height and explicit semantic hover/active states.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\">Continue</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:var(--a-font-sans);font-weight:600;line-height:1.75;border-radius:var(--an-radius-pill);min-height:var(--an-control-height);padding:6px 20px;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 100ms var(--a-ease-standard);background:var(--a-color-primary);color:var(--a-color-primary-fg);border:0}.ds-primary:hover{background:var(--a-color-primary-hover)}.ds-primary:active{background:var(--a-color-primary-active)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--a-color-ring);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Outlined supporting action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-secondary\">Cancel</button>",
      "css": ".ds-secondary{font-family:var(--a-font-sans);font-weight:600;line-height:1.75;border-radius:999px;min-height:44px;padding:6px 20px;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 100ms var(--a-ease-standard);background:transparent;color:var(--a-color-fg);border:1px solid var(--a-color-border-input);padding:5px 20px}.ds-secondary:hover{background:var(--a-color-surface-hover);border-color:var(--a-color-border-strong)}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--a-color-ring);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tertiary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-tertiary",
      "description": "Quiet text action with pill hit area.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-tertiary\">Back</button>",
      "css": ".ds-tertiary{font-family:var(--a-font-sans);font-weight:600;line-height:1.75;border-radius:999px;min-height:44px;padding:6px 20px;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 100ms var(--a-ease-standard);background:transparent;color:var(--a-color-primary);border:0}.ds-tertiary:hover{background:var(--a-color-primary-subtle)}.ds-tertiary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--a-color-ring);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workspace panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Flat white panel using canvas contrast rather than elevation.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2>My tasks</h2><p>Requests waiting for your decision.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{background:var(--a-color-surface);color:var(--a-color-fg);border-radius:20px;padding:28px;font-family:var(--a-font-sans)}.ds-panel h2{font-family:var(--an-font-display);font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px}.ds-panel p{color:var(--a-color-fg-muted);margin:0;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75}@media(max-width:639px){.ds-panel{padding:20px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Setup field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "setup-field",
      "description": "Shared filled inset-label field; empty and focused label states use the same interior geometry.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span>Company name</span><input value=\"Lotus Logistics\" placeholder=\" \" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{position:relative;display:block;font-family:var(--a-font-sans);color:var(--a-color-fg-muted)}.ds-field span{position:absolute;left:18px;top:7px;font-size:0.84375rem;pointer-events:none}.ds-field input{width:calc(100% - 38px);min-height:27px;line-height:1.5;border:1px solid var(--a-color-border-input);border-radius:var(--an-radius-field);padding:26px 18px 10px;background:var(--a-color-surface);color:var(--a-color-fg);font-family:var(--a-font-sans);font-size:1.125rem}.ds-field:has(input:placeholder-shown):not(:focus-within) span{top:19px;font-size:1.125rem}.ds-field input:hover{border-color:var(--a-color-fg)}.ds-field:focus-within span{color:var(--a-color-primary)}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--a-color-primary);outline-offset:-2px}.ds-field:has(input[aria-invalid=\"true\"]) span{color:var(--an-color-error)}.ds-field input[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--an-color-error);background:var(--an-color-error-surface)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-selected",
      "description": "Pale-blue selected route with icon, weight and aria-current.",
      "html": "<nav><a href=\"#home\" aria-current=\"page\" class=\"ds-nav\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 10 9-7 9 7v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-7H9v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z\"/></svg>Home</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:52px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:15px;font:600 1rem var(--a-font-sans);text-decoration:none;background:var(--a-color-surface-selected);color:var(--a-color-primary-subtle-fg)}.ds-nav:hover{background:var(--a-color-surface-hover)}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--a-color-ring);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Compact outlined textual status with optional dot.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Pending</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--a-color-border-strong);border-radius:15px;height:26px;padding:0 8px;font:500 0.75rem var(--a-font-sans);color:var(--a-color-fg)}.ds-badge>span{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Process choice",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "process-choice",
      "description": "Selected setup card with the icon/check upper row and approval-route copy.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-choice\"><span class=\"ds-choice-row\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 3h9l3 3v15H6zM9 11h6M9 15h6\"/></svg><input type=\"checkbox\" checked aria-label=\"Purchase requests\" /></span><strong>Purchase requests</strong><span>Manager → Finance</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-choice{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:174px;padding:28px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--a-color-primary);background:var(--a-color-surface);color:var(--a-color-fg);font-family:var(--a-font-sans);cursor:pointer}.ds-choice-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;color:var(--a-color-fg-link)}.ds-choice input{accent-color:var(--a-color-primary);width:20px;height:20px}.ds-choice strong{margin-top:28px;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600}.ds-choice>span:last-child{margin-top:12px;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--a-color-fg-muted)}.ds-choice:hover{background:var(--a-color-surface-hover)}.ds-choice:focus-within{outline:2px solid var(--a-color-ring);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Checkbox",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "checkbox",
      "description": "Shared squared checkbox with semantic selected fill and focus ring.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked /><span>Remember me</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-check{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:1rem var(--a-font-sans);color:var(--a-color-fg-muted)}.ds-check input{appearance:none;display:grid;place-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;margin:0;border:2px solid var(--a-color-border-input);border-radius:5px;background:var(--a-color-surface);cursor:pointer}.ds-check input:checked{border-color:var(--a-color-primary);background:var(--a-color-primary)}.ds-check input:checked::after{content:\"\";width:10px;height:5px;border-left:3px solid var(--a-color-primary-fg);border-bottom:3px solid var(--a-color-primary-fg);transform:translateY(-1px) rotate(-45deg)}.ds-check input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--a-color-ring);outline-offset:2px}.ds-check input:disabled{opacity:0.45}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Password field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "auth-field",
      "description": "Auth password visual preview; runtime PasswordInput supplies the accessible visibility toggle.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-password\"><span>Password</span><input type=\"password\" value=\"example\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" /><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Show password\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg></button></label>",
      "css": ".ds-password{display:block;position:relative;font-family:var(--a-font-sans)}.ds-password>span{position:absolute;top:10px;left:20px;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--a-color-fg-muted)}.ds-password input{width:calc(100% - 74px);height:27px;padding:32px 54px 16px 18px;border:1px solid var(--a-color-border-input);border-radius:var(--an-radius-field);background:var(--a-color-surface);color:var(--a-color-fg);font-size:1.25rem}.ds-password button{position:absolute;right:12px;top:18px;display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;border:0;border-radius:var(--an-radius-pill);background:transparent;color:var(--a-color-fg-muted);cursor:pointer}.ds-password button:hover{background:var(--a-color-surface-hover)}.ds-password input:focus-visible,.ds-password button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--a-color-ring);outline-offset:2px}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-password input{padding-top:26px;padding-bottom:10px;font-size:1.125rem}.ds-password>span{top:7px;left:18px}.ds-password button{top:12px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Verification code",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "code-digit",
      "description": "Six responsive slots; runtime CodeInput supplies paste, autofill and keyboard advancement.",
      "html": "<fieldset class=\"ds-code\"><legend>Verification code</legend><div><input inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-label=\"Digit 1 of 6\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" /><input inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-label=\"Digit 2 of 6\" autocomplete=\"off\" /><input inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-label=\"Digit 3 of 6\" autocomplete=\"off\" /><input inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-label=\"Digit 4 of 6\" autocomplete=\"off\" /><input inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-label=\"Digit 5 of 6\" autocomplete=\"off\" /><input inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-label=\"Digit 6 of 6\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div></fieldset>",
      "css": ".ds-code{border:0;padding:0;margin:0;min-width:0;font-family:var(--a-font-sans)}.ds-code legend{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%)}.ds-code>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.ds-code input{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;height:76px;padding:16px 0;text-align:center;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--a-color-fg);background:var(--a-color-surface);border:1px solid var(--a-color-border-input);border-radius:var(--an-radius-field)}.ds-code input:hover{border-color:var(--a-color-fg)}.ds-code input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--a-color-primary);outline-offset:-2px}.ds-code input[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--an-color-error);background:var(--an-color-error-surface)}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-code>div{gap:8px}.ds-code input{height:58px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Select menu",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Token-colored dropdown options with a quiet group heading and pale-blue selected row.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-select\"><button aria-expanded=\"true\">My tasks <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><div role=\"listbox\"><div role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\">My tasks</div><div role=\"option\">Everyone</div><p>People</p><div role=\"option\">Alex Tan</div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-select{width:220px;font-family:var(--a-font-sans);font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--a-color-fg)}.ds-select button{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 12px;border:2px solid var(--a-color-primary);border-radius:var(--an-radius-field);background:var(--a-color-surface);color:var(--a-color-fg);font:inherit}.ds-select [role=listbox]{max-height:240px;overflow:auto;margin-top:4px;border-radius:var(--an-radius-field);background:var(--a-color-surface);box-shadow:0 14px 36px rgb(13 37 73 / 16%)}.ds-select [role=option]{box-sizing:border-box;min-height:44px;padding:12px 16px}.ds-select [aria-selected=true]{background:var(--a-color-surface-selected);color:var(--a-color-fg-link);font-weight:600}.ds-select p{margin:0;padding:10px 16px 4px;color:var(--a-color-fg-muted);font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600}.ds-select button span{width:8px;height:8px;border-right:1.5px solid var(--a-color-fg-muted);border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--a-color-fg-muted);transform:rotate(45deg)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "overview": "The user selected Remote marketing, onboarding, login, verification and workspace references as the visual authority. Anumat's built system applies their cool gray canvas, spacious white panels, rounded near-black headings and cobalt pill actions while retaining the Anumat logo and its existing browser-only workflows.\n\nMarketing uses large editorial headings, the actual Anumat Home preview and original textured mint-and-blue folder art. Setup pairs generous outlined fields with inset floating labels, a centered header and blue progress line. Login, recovery and verification use a white form area beside a navy-and-cobalt geometric panel. The workspace gives tasks the broad main canvas, keeps navigation on a white sidebar and quiets utilities in gray. This is the documented implementation, not a claim of full parity with Remote.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool gray canvas and generous white rounded panels.",
      "Rounded display headings with readable Inter product text.",
      "Cobalt actions and pale-blue selected navigation.",
      "Original textured folder art beside actual Anumat UI imagery.",
      "Responsive layouts with light/dark and English/Khmer preferences."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve the Anumat logo and the user-selected Remote visual direction.",
      "Do build new controls through the app-owned MUI adapters and semantic CSS variables.",
      "Do retain visible focus, labels and textual status alongside color.",
      "Do let long translated copy wrap and keep mobile utilities inside the viewport.",
      "Do reuse the original folder art and actual Anumat UI preview with their recorded provenance."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't reintroduce the removed public heading eyebrows.",
      "Don't imply working authentication, sent invitations or server provisioning through presentation.",
      "Don't copy Remote logos, product screenshots or unsupported trust claims.",
      "Don't turn every white panel into a floating shadow card.",
      "Don't use literal light-theme colors for new shared controls."
    ]
  }
